sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Learner
  participant A as API (CoursesService)
  participant Q as UsageService
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  U->>A: POST /courses { title, description?, language }
  A->>A: Zod createCourseSchema (strict)
  A->>Q: consume(userId, COURSES_CREATED, work)
  rect rgb(244, 244, 245)
    Note over Q,D: một transaction
    Q->>D: đọc Plan của Subscription hiện hành
    Q->>D: pg_advisory_xact_lock(hash(userId, metric))
    Q->>D: COUNT Course WHERE ownerId AND deletedAt IS NULL
    alt used >= limit
      Q-->>U: 402 QUOTA_EXCEEDED { metric, limit, used }
    else còn suất
      Q->>D: INSERT Course (status DRAFT)
    end
  end
  A-->>U: 201 CourseDetail
